<td><span id="field-potd" title="20160208"></span><div lang="en">This image was selected as <b><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Picture_of_the_day" title="Commons:Picture of the day">picture of the day</a></b> on Wikimedia Commons for <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Potd/2016-02#8" title="Template:Potd/2016-02">8 February 2016</a>. It was captioned as follows:</div><div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English: </b></span> Domestic <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/cat" class="extiw" title="w:cat">cat</a> on snow, a ten month old female.</div><div class="tpl-hidden mw-collapsible mw-collapsed">
<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r922807911">.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden{clear:both}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden>.mw-collapsible-toggle{float:none}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden::before{display:none}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{padding-left:20px;background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_action_arrow.png");background-position:left 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible.mw-collapsed>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_right_arrow.png")}.mw-parser-output [dir=rtl] .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible.mw-collapsed>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_left_arrow.png")}</style>
<div class="mw-collapsible-toggle" style="font-weight:bold; ; text-align:start; float:none;font-size:smaller;"><span class="tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle skin-invert"></span><span class="tpl-hidden-headertext">Other languages:</span></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="font-weight:normal; color: inherit;; text-align:start;">
<div class="multilingual"><div class="description bs lang-bs" lang="bs" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-bs" lang="bs" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Bosanski</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://bs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ma%C4%8Dka" class="extiw" title="bs:Mačka">Domaća mačka</a> na snijegu, deset mjeseci stara ženka.</div><div class="description cs lang-cs" lang="cs" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-cs" lang="cs" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Čeština</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ko%C4%8Dka_dom%C3%A1c%C3%AD" class="extiw" title="cs:Kočka domácí">Kočka domácí</a> (odrostlé kotě) ve věku 10 měsíců na sněhu.</div><div class="description en lang-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-en" lang="en" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>English</bdi>: </span> Domestic <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/cat" class="extiw" title="w:cat">cat</a> on snow, a ten month old female.</div><div class="description es lang-es" lang="es" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-es" lang="es" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Español</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felis_silvestris_catus" class="extiw" title="es:Felis silvestris catus">Gata doméstica</a> (<i><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Felis_silvestris_catus" title="Felis silvestris catus">Felis silvestris catus</a></i>) de diez meses en la nieve.</div><div class="description fr lang-fr" lang="fr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fr" lang="fr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Français</bdi> : </span> Un <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chat" class="extiw" title="fr:Chat">chat domestique</a> femelle de dix mois dans la neige.</div><div class="description it lang-it" lang="it" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-it" lang="it" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Italiano</bdi>: </span> Gatto domestico (<i><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Felis_silvestris_catus" title="Felis silvestris catus">Felis silvestris catus</a></i>) sulla neve.</div><div class="description hu lang-hu" lang="hu" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-hu" lang="hu" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Magyar</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macska" class="extiw" title="hu:Macska">Macska</a> (<i>Felis silvestris catus</i>) a <a href="https://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/h%C3%B3" class="extiw" title="hu:hó">hóban</a></div><div class="description nl lang-nl" lang="nl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-nl" lang="nl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Nederlands</bdi>: </span> Een tien maanden oude <a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kat_(dier)" class="extiw" title="nl:Kat (dier)">poes</a> in de sneeuw.</div><div class="description pl lang-pl" lang="pl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pl" lang="pl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Polski</bdi>: </span> Dziesięciomiesięczna samica <a href="https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kot_domowy" class="extiw" title="pl:Kot domowy">kota domowego</a>.</div><div class="description pt lang-pt" lang="pt" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pt" lang="pt" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Português</bdi>: </span> <a href="https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gato" class="extiw" title="pt:Gato">Gata</a> (<i>Felis silvestris catus</i>) de dez meses na <a href="https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neve" class="extiw" title="pt:Neve">neve</a>.</div><div class="description mk lang-mk" lang="mk" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-mk" lang="mk" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Македонски</bdi>: </span> Домашна <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B0" class="extiw" title="w:мачка">мачка</a> на снег (женка стара 10 месеци).</div><div class="description ru lang-ru" lang="ru" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ru" lang="ru" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Русский</bdi>: </span> Домашняя <a href="https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0" class="extiw" title="ru:кошка">кошка</a> в возрасте десяти месяцев.</div><div class="description ko lang-ko" lang="ko" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ko" lang="ko" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>한국어</bdi>: </span> 눈 위의 <a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B3%A0%EC%96%91%EC%9D%B4" class="extiw" title="ko:고양이">집고양이</a>. 10개월된 암코양이.</div><div class="description zh lang-zh" lang="zh" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh" lang="zh" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文</bdi>：</span> 在雪地上的一只十个月大的母<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8C%AB" class="extiw" title="zh:猫">家猫</a>。</div><div class="description zh-hant lang-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文（繁體）</bdi>：</span> 在雪地上的一隻十個月大的母<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B2%93" class="extiw" title="zh:貓">家貓</a>。</div></div>
</div></div>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
